# Frontend (Next.js)

- Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing Next.js code — this project uses Next.js 16 with breaking changes.
- App Router pages under `app/`. Arena components in `components/arena/`, shadcn UI in `components/ui/`.
- Call backend via relative `/api/*` paths (proxied to `:8000`).
- Mirror backend Pydantic models in `lib/types.ts` when changing API contracts.
